sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Caller
    participant ISA as laplace_isa_execute
    participant Validator as laplace_isa_validate
    participant Binding as Opcode binding
    participant Receipt
    Caller->>ISA: program, receipt pointer, error pointer
    alt receipt pointer is null
        ISA-->>Caller: INVALID_ARGUMENT
    else receipt available
        ISA->>Receipt: Clear; copy available program metadata
        ISA->>Validator: Validate entire program
        Validator-->>ISA: Typed status
        alt validation fails
            ISA->>Receipt: Set failure status
            ISA-->>Caller: Validation status
        else valid program
            ISA->>ISA: Fingerprint context, program, inputs
            Note over ISA: Fingerprint failures return typed error
            loop Instructions in order; stops on first failure
                ISA->>Binding: Lookup opcode; execute(program, instruction)
                Binding-->>ISA: Typed status
                ISA->>Receipt: Record completed instruction count
            end
            alt binding missing or execution failed
                ISA->>Receipt: Set failure status
                ISA-->>Caller: Error: instruction and output-value index
                Note over Caller,ISA: Earlier instruction effects are not rolled back by this function
            else all instructions succeeded
                ISA->>ISA: Hash outputs
                alt output hashing fails
                    ISA-->>Caller: RESOURCE_INSUFFICIENT
                else output hash succeeds
                    ISA->>Receipt: Set OK; hash receipt
                    ISA->>ISA: Clear error
                    ISA-->>Caller: OK
                end
            end
        end
    end
